# These are process environment variables read by the MCP server, the daemon and
# their hooks. No code loads a .env file, so set them in the env block of your
# agent's MCP server entry or export them in the shell that starts the agent.

# Absolute path of the project root where .northstar/ comments are stored.
# Defaults to the current working directory when the server starts.
# NORTHSTAR_ROOT=/path/to/your/project

# Folder that holds the .northstar directory with the config, the session state, the
# logs and the daemon socket. Defaults to your home directory. Unix sockets allow only
# about 100 characters, so keep this path short.
# NORTHSTAR_HOME=/home/you

# Tool packs to enable at start: dynamic, all, or a comma list such as research,system.
# NORTHSTAR_PACKS=dynamic

# Set to off to open the DESIGN.md gate for UI edits. Only for a user who asked to skip it.
# NORTHSTAR_GATE=off
